# the Key page (FX's fifth): Key, Scale, Chord and Drift, one setting for every mood and scene. A fixed key and
# scale hold through a mood change, and the mood's own come back with Mood; Held keeps the home chord; the settings
# are kept across a power-off and go back to Mood with the reset (SAVE held)
wait 800
expect tonic 9
expect scalenow 1
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
wait 300
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect tonic 2
spin K2 2
wait 300
expect scalenow 0
spin K3 1
wait 300
expect chord 0
wait 200000
expect chord 0
# Golden Hour: its own key a fourth down and Min'yo, but the page holds D and In
turn ALGO 3
wait 300
expect knob0 3
wait 33000
expect tonic 2
expect scalenow 0
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
wait 300
spin K1 -3
spin K2 -2
wait 300
expect tonic 4
expect scalenow 2
# kept: G, across a power-off
spin K1 8
wait 25000
reboot
wait 800
expect tonic 7
# the reset: as the mood has it again
press SAVE
wait 3500
release SAVE
wait 1500
expect tonic 9
